{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】選舉委員會換屆選舉開始投票，首一小時已有約4成半選民投票。</p>\n<p>今次選舉有5709人登記為投票人。選委會40個界別中，有31個需投票。</p>\n<p>截至上午10時，有2554人投票，投票率44.74%，較上一屆多30個百分點。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T03:22:18.391646+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T03:03:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T03:15:48.006759+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T03:15:48.006759+00:00","content_hash":"0c19664f47a422073e7c99ce0d8534914b1c9b961f512a6d1a0a895bea57fcde","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}